  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Plugin Doctor for DSH",
      "text": "> Static check of an installed DSH profile: dependencies vs `node_modules`, bundle patch existence,\n> duplicate patch ids/names. Local-only."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-plugin-doctor.mjs --home ~/.dsh --profile web\nnode bin/dsh-plugin-doctor.mjs --json\n```\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse plugin_doctor with profile=web.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Checks",
      "text": "- dependencies declared in the profile `package.json`\n- installed `node_modules/<name>/package.json`\n- each `dsh.bundle.patch` target\n- duplicate `cordis.patch.yml` ids/names"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- No install/boot/runtime/network\n- No pnpm workspace edge-case resolution\n- Missing bundle patch is a warning: client-only/host plugins may be legitimate\n- Not a repair tool"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Provenance",
      "text": "A small independent profile inspector. License: MIT."
    }
